TITLE 1D transport, exchange in all cells

SOLUTION 0  Inflow
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step cell sc
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, CELL_NO, SC

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant constant
    -print_cells 8
    -print_frequency 1
    -punch_cells 8
    -punch_frequency 1
END
